## Development

### Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/haianhace123/rewind.git

cd rewind
```

### Install development dependencies

```bash
pip install -e .[dev]
```

### Run tests

```bash
pytest tests/ -v
```

### Run formatters and type checks

```bash
black rewind/

isort rewind/

mypy rewind/
```

